# CalcPro — Netlify redirects (SPA fallback + soft-404 fix)
# ORDER MATTERS: Netlify matches top-to-bottom, first match wins, and redirect
# rules override static files — so real root files MUST come before the asset
# wildcards below, or robots.txt/sitemap.xml/etc. would be 404'd by them.
# 1) Real root files — never catch these with the asset-404 wildcards
/robots.txt     /robots.txt     200
/sitemap.xml    /sitemap.xml    200
/llms.txt       /llms.txt       200
/ads.txt        /ads.txt        200
/manifest.json  /manifest.json  200
/og-image.png   /og-image.png   200
/og-image.html  /og-image.html  200
/icon.svg       /icon.svg       200
# 2) Static legal/About pages — separate standalone HTML for crawlers & no-JS users
/about              /about.html             200
/privacy            /privacy.html           200
/terms              /terms.html             200
/cookies            /cookies.html           200
/contact            /contact.html           200
/disclaimer-general /disclaimer-general.html 200
/disclaimer-finance /disclaimer-finance.html 200
/disclaimer-health  /disclaimer-health.html  200
# 3) Renamed tools — permanent redirects from old URLs (preserves backlinks/bookmarks)
/everyday/fuel-cost          /everyday/trip-fuel-cost           301
/conversion/fuel-efficiency  /conversion/fuel-efficiency-converter 301
/finance/ltv                 /finance/loan-to-value             301
/career/freelance-rate       /career/freelance-hourly-rate      301
/finance/net-worth           /finance/net-worth-calculator      301
/tech/battery-life           /tech/battery-life-estimator       301
/fitness/walking-steps       /fitness/steps-to-distance         301
/food/water-intake           /food/daily-water-intake           301
/health/water-intake         /health/water-intake-health        301
/lifestyle/moving-cost       /lifestyle/relocation-cost         301
/lifestyle/grocery-budget    /lifestyle/grocery-budget-optimizer 301
/health/ideal-weight         /health/ideal-body-weight          301
/family/pregnancy-weight     /family/pregnancy-weight-gain      301
/regional/wedding-budget     /regional/wedding-budget-shaadi    301
# 4) Missing assets (.js/.css/.png/.svg etc.) → true 404 (NOT index.html 200)
/*.js    /404.html   404
/*.css   /404.html   404
/*.png   /404.html   404
/*.jpg   /404.html   404
/*.jpeg  /404.html   404
/*.gif   /404.html   404
/*.svg   /404.html   404
/*.ico   /404.html   404
/*.xml   /404.html   404
/*.txt   /404.html   404
/*.json  /404.html   404
/*.webmanifest /404.html   404
/*.woff2 /404.html   404
# 5) Clean URL routes (extensionless) → SPA index.html with 200
/*    /index.html   200
